title: 'Containment, forks, links: all unaffected'
pid: 7b0f6c66-777d-4f2b-9d1c-4d8c7c974d98
body: |2-
  All graph relationships are by ID, not =(ID, repo)=. The set of
  relationships to/from the moved node is invariant under a skgrepo move.
  Don't expect anything related to graph topology to change.
